  "question": {
    "text": "If the potential energy between two molecules is given by&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>U</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>A</mi><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>6</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mi>B</mi><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>12</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>,</mo></math> then at equilibrium, separation between molecules, and the potential energy are:"
